     fhir:Narrative.div "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><div xml:lang=\"en\" lang=\"en\"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.TranslateContent</b></p><a name=\"SGAuthoring.Skills.TranslateContent\"> </a><a name=\"hcSGAuthoring.Skills.TranslateContent\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>These requirements apply to the actor <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.Translator.html\">Translator</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"TRANS-01\"> </a></b>Translate narrative pages</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can translate IG narrative page content (markdown/HTML) to target UN languages.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"TRANS-02\"> </a></b>Translate resource metadata</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can translate FHIR resource display names, titles, and descriptions.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"TRANS-03\"> </a></b>Manage translation files</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can manage .pot/.po translation template files and the translation extraction/registration workflow.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"TRANS-04\"> </a></b>Coordinate domain terminology</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHOULD\">SHOULD</a></td><td><div><p>Can coordinate with clinical SMEs for domain-specific terminology in translations.</p>\n</div></td></tr></table></div><div xml:lang=\"fr\" lang=\"fr\"><hr/><p><b>French</b></p><hr/><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Narratif généré : Requirements SGAuthoring.Skills.TranslateContent</b></p><a name=\"fr-SGAuthoring.Skills.TranslateContent\"> </a><a name=\"fr-hcSGAuthoring.Skills.TranslateContent\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profil: <a href=\"StructureDefinition-SGRequirements.html\">SMART Guidelines Requirements</a></p></div><p>Ces exigences s'appliquent à l'acteur <a href=\"ActorDefinition-SGAuthoring.Persona.Translator.html\">Translator</a></p><table class=\"grid\"><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-TRANS-01\"> </a></b>Translate narrative pages</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can translate IG narrative page content (markdown/HTML) to target UN languages.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-TRANS-02\"> </a></b>Translate resource metadata</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can translate FHIR resource display names, titles, and descriptions.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-TRANS-03\"> </a></b>Manage translation files</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhir/uv/xver-r5.r4/0.1.0/CodeSystem-conformance-expectation.html#conformance-expectation-SHALL\">SHALL</a></td><td><div><p>Can manage .pot/.po translation template files and the translation extraction/registration workflow.</p>\n</div></td></tr><tr><td><b><a name=\"fr-TRANS-04\"> </a></b>Coordinate domain terminology</td><td><a href=\"http://hl7.org/fhi